<section class="workbench" aria-labelledby="dossier-tools">
<h2 id="dossier-tools">Your operation record</h2>
<p>Practice is saved in this browser after you press Save. Export a backup to keep it elsewhere. No account or submission is created.</p>
<p class="status" role="status" data-global-status>Enable JavaScript to save a local dossier. The course and worksheets remain readable.</p>
<div class="actions">
<button type="button" data-export="json" disabled>Export backup JSON</button>
<button type="button" data-export="markdown" disabled>Export dossier Markdown</button>
<button type="button" data-print disabled>Print dossier</button>
</div>
<label for="dossier-import">Import a dossier backup (JSON, up to 1 MB)</label>
<input type="file" id="dossier-import" accept=".json,application/json" data-import disabled/>
<div class="actions"><button type="button" data-load-sample disabled>Load labelled sample dossier</button><button type="button" data-reset disabled>New operation / reset</button></div>
<p class="small">Import and reset ask before replacing existing work. An invalid file never replaces it.</p>
</section>
<script>import "../scripts/academy-client";</script>
